{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"tl-v1","tool":"ragflow_retrieval","arguments":{"dataset_ids":["918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37"],"question":"CIPH-15 Docker image 450MB CVE verification failing release gate evidence","metadata_condition":{"logic":"and","conditions":[{"name":"path","comparison_operator":"is","value":"sources"}]},"page_size":10,"vector_similarity_weight":0.3,"similarity_threshold":0.2,"top_k":1024,"keyword":false},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"chunks\": [{\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-15\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Title**: Docker Packaging\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-11\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nContainerize CipherDoc's API and CLI into a Docker image (WS-03). The initial Dockerfile was completed on 2026-06-16, but Diana's size/CVE review reopened the task on 2026-06-25 after the built image measured 2.1GB. Evan is redesigning the build as multi-stage toward a ~450MB target, swapped the base image to Alpine, and removed unused OCR and runtime packages that were not needed at runtime. As of the 2026-08-12 size/CVE verification, the image still exceeds the ~450MB target and CVE verification remains outstanding. This ClickUp record was opened at task creation; the reopening and remediation steps above were tracked through engineering channels.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-15\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Title**: Docker Packaging\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-11\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Image size reduced to the ~450MB target (not yet met).\\n\\n- CVE verification passes with no outstanding findings (not yet met).\\n\\n- Task stays Active (Reopened) until both size and CVE checks pass.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-15\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Title**: Docker Packaging\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-11\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nContainerize CipherDoc's API and CLI into a Docker image (WS-03). The initial Dockerfile was completed on 2026-06-16, but Diana's size/CVE review reopened the task on 2026-06-25 after the built image measured 2.1GB. Evan is redesigning the build as multi-stage toward a ~450MB target, swapped the base image to Alpine, and removed unused OCR and runtime packages that were not needed at runtime. As of the 2026-08-12 size/CVE verification, the image still exceeds the ~450MB target and CVE verification remains outstanding. This ClickUp record was opened at task creation; the reopening and remediation steps above were tracked through engineering channels.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 15 sourc id src cu ciph 15 task id ciph 15 titl docker packag status activ reopen assigne evan prioriti normal date creat 2026 06 11 descript container cipherdoc s api and cli into a docker imag w 03 the initi dockerfil wa complet on 2026 06 16 but diana s size cve review reopen the task on 2026 06 25 after the built imag measur 2 1gb evan is redesign the build a multi stage toward a 450mb target swap the base imag to alpin and remov unus ocr and runtim packag that were not need at runtim a of the 2026 08 12 size cve verif the imag still exceed the 450mb target and cve verif remain outstand this clickup record wa open at task creation the reopen and remedi step abov were track through engin channel clickup task ciph 15 sourc id src cu ciph 15 task id ciph 15 titl docker packag status activ reopen assigne evan prioriti normal date creat 2026 06 11 accept criterion imag size reduc to the 450mb target not yet met cve verif pass with no outstand find not yet met task stay activ reopen until both size and cve check pas clickup task ciph 15 sourc id src cu ciph 15 t