ification found the CLI-emitted audit records inconsistent with the defined schema; this mismatch remains an open release blocker.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"open the task to build a central audit trail system for track redact activ across the pipelin 2026 07 11 bob loader refactor activ refactor the document loader to prepar for stream input ahead of hash and audit captur 2026 08 05 bob sha 256 hash activ ad sha 256 hash of input stream becaus the audit design requir an input hash alongsid the redact map 2026 08 15 bob audit schema definit activ defin the companion json audit schema hash redact map need befor cli wire 2026 09 10 bob cli integr activ wire audit log generat into the cli path now that the schema wa defin to satisfi the releas gate 2026 09 18 diana audit verifi mismatch activ verif found the cli emit audit record inconsist with the defin schema this mismatch remain an open releas blocker\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee5c42ce8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"id\": \"27857d38103c6293\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3604427273419959, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2243370847742798, \"vector_similarity\": 0.67802256, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee5c42ce8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2011, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:15\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:06:52\", \"token_count\": 759, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Sou